    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/navid/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Navid is a modern, blazing-fast magazine and blog WordPress theme crafted for publishers, editors, and daily news portals. Whether you are running a personal tech blog, a lifestyle magazine, or a heavy-content newspaper, Navid delivers a premium reading experience. It features a cinematic hero section, a beautiful dark mode, sticky headers, a dynamic bento box grid, and a classic marquee news ticker. Built with SEO and core web vitals in mind, it provides the perfect typography and layout to keep readers engaged. Navid is highly customizable and works seamlessly with popular page builders like Elementor, as well as Gutenberg block libraries like Kadence Blocks and Spectra. Perfect for daily journalism, creative portfolios, review sites, and modern editorial platforms."
    },
